      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELECTROJET (1) boasts a strong record this journey with nine wins and nine minors from 26 tries. Below best last time at Healesville (19.63) in a Grade 5 FIN, finishing a 7 length eighth. Looks suited here and rates on top. PAW ISLA (4) was well off top last time, finishing 6th (28.38) in a Grade 5 FIN at Bendigo. Great record here at the trip having never missed the frame including one win. Boasts four wins from four starts out of this box. Key runner on best form. DID NOT (7) hit the ground running from out wide and on speed early but faded and swamped late when 6th at Geelong in Grade 4/5 company. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Cannot be underestimated. BUSH BIG SHOW (2) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
